        <mxCell id="ver_title" value="&lt;b&gt;Version Detection Logic&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;fontSize=14;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="200" y="570" width="400" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ver_flow" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;_is_zm_137_or_later(zm_version)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. Parse version string → tuple (e.g. &quot;1.38.0&quot; → (1, 38, 0))&lt;br&gt;2. Compare parsed ≥ (1, 37)&lt;br&gt;3. If True: read Capturing/Analysing/Recording from raw monitor dict&lt;br&gt;4. If all three present: derive MonitorState via _derive_function()&lt;br&gt;5. If derivation fails (unmapped combo): fall back to Function column&lt;br&gt;6. If False or version unknown: use legacy Function column directly&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Write path (function setter):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• ZM ≥ 1.37: POST Monitor[Capturing], Monitor[Analysing], Monitor[Recording]&lt;br&gt;• ZM &lt; 1.37: POST Monitor[Function]&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;align=left;spacingLeft=10;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="80" y="610" width="550" height="220" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
